---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Make several addresses one person, by hand. mxr only ever suggests a merge (same name, you've written to both); --suggestions lists them

Usage: mxr messages merge [OPTIONS] [INTO] [ADDRESSES]...

Arguments:
  [INTO]          The person's main address
  [ADDRESSES]...  Addresses to merge in

Options:
      --suggestions        List the merges mxr suggests instead
      --dry-run            Show the person it would make without changing anything
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
